  "content": "```html\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>关于</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模组是Jackyy的部分模组在1.12.2及更高版本的支持库，由于其本身仅是一个库模组，所以不具备任何功能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">当前依赖此库模组的模组如下：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exchangers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Exchangers</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-sponge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Simple Sponge</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensional-edibles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Dimensional Edibles</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Avaritia Tweaks</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integration-foregoing\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Integration Foregoing</strong></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fjacky\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/6e84f40947436e91e8ef4123f7db14a4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"256\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>源代码和许可证</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模组为开源软件。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可以在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/JackyyTV/GunpowderLib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>&nbsp;上找到源代码。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模组采用 <a href=\"https://github.com/JackyyTV/GunpowderLib/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jacky的Minecraft模组许可协议</a>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只要您是从 CurseForge 或 GitHub 获取的原始未修改版本，就可以随意将此模组用于任何启动器的任何整合包中。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>联系我</strong></span></h3>\nTwitter / X - <a href=\"https://github.com/JackyyTV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@JackyyTV</a><br>\nInstagram - <a href=\"https://github.com/jackyytv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@jackyytv</a>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjackyy.hk%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord -&nbsp;jackyytv</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.reddit.com/message/compose/?to=JackyyTV\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reddit - JackyyTV</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">注意：我不会接受CurseForge上的私信，所有私信都会被忽略。如果您想与我联系，推荐使用Discord。</span></li>\n\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>支持开发</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果您喜欢这个模组并希望能支持我的模组开发，考虑打赏！所有打赏都会受到感谢！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&gt;&gt;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstreamlabs.com%252fJackyy\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处通过Streamlabs打赏</a>&lt;&lt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&gt;&gt;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjackyy\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处通过Ko-fi打赏</a>&lt;&lt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">除了打赏，您还可以通过在Patreon或Twitch上关注我来支持我！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&gt;&gt;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Jackyy\" rel=\"nofollow\">在Patreon上订阅</a>&lt;&lt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&gt;&gt;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsubs.twitch.tv%252fJackyy\" rel=\"nofollow\">在Twitch上订阅</a>&lt;&lt;</span></p></ul>\n```",
